mething is wrong.\\nThe feeling is real.\\nThe conclusion still needs evidence.\"},{\"step_number\":3,\"key\":\"reality_check\",\"tip\":\"Ask \\\"What happened?\\\" before asking \\\"How are you feeling?\\\" or \\\"What\'s bothering you?\\\"\",\"inputs\":[{\"field_key\":\"q1\",\"prompt\":\"1. What fact do you know for certain?\"},{\"field_key\":\"q2\",\"prompt\":\"2. What are you assuming?\"},{\"field_key\":\"q3\",\"prompt\":\"3. What evidence supports your assumption?\"},{\"field_key\":\"q4\",\"prompt\":\"4. What evidence contradicts it?\"},{\"field_key\":\"q5\",\"prompt\":\"5. If someone else described this situation, what would you tell them?\"}]},{\"step_number\":4,\"key\":\"reframe\",\"inputs\":[{\"field_key\":\"alt_explanations\",\"prompt\":\"Write at least 3 other explanations that also fit the facts.\",\"type\":\"multi_entry\",\"min_entries\":3},{\"field_key\":\"one_more_explanation\",\"prompt\":\"Can you think of one explanation that has nothing to do with you?\"}],\"reference_example\":[\"He had a tiring day.\",\"He is thinking about something unrelated.\",\"He isn\'t feeling physically well.\",\"He simply isn\'t in the mood to talk much today.\"]},{\"step_number\":5,\"key\":\"intervention\",\"reminder\":\"There isn\'t always a perfect action.\\nThere is usually one reasonable action based on the evidence available.\",\"inputs\":[{\"field_key\":\"action\",\"prompt\":\"Based on the evidence available, what is one thoughtful action you can take?\"}],\"reference_example\":\"Rather than assuming something is wrong, wait for an appropriate moment and calmly ask:\\n\\\"You seemed quieter than usual today. Is everything okay?\\\"\\nThen listen without assuming the answer.\"},{\"step_number\":6,\"key\":\"internalize\",\"inputs\":[{\"field_key\":\"principle\",\"prompt\":\"Complete this sentence: \\\"Today I learned that...\\\"\"}],\"reference_example\":\"Feeling worried doesn\'t prove that something is wrong. Feelings deserve attention, but conclusions require evidence.\"}],\"closing_reflection\":{\"prompt\":\"Where else in my life have I mistaken a feeling for a fact?\",\"journal_input\":{\"field_key\":\"journal\",\"prompt\":\"Optional journal entry — user may type or speak a personal reflection here (not scored).\",\"required\":false}}}', `updated_at` = '2026-09-25 16:36:12';

INSERT INTO `foundation_days` (`day_number`, `phase`, `title`, `domain`, `primary_trap`, `secondary_trap`, `content_bundle`, `created_at`, `updated_at`)
VALUES (4, 1, 'The Internet Diagnosis', 'Health', 'Catastrophizing', NULL, '{\"day\":4,\"phase\":1,\"title\":\"The Internet Diagnosis\",\"domain\":\"Health\",\"mission\":\"One possibility is not the only possibility.\",\"learning_objective\":\"Generate Alternative Explanations\",\"difficulty\":\"Beginner\",\"emotional_intensity\":\"Moderate\",\"estimated_minutes\":\"3-5\",\"primary_skill\":\"Reframe\",\"primary_trap\":\"Catastrophizing\",\"secondary_trap\":null,\"scenario_text\":\"You notice a small lump on your neck.\\nIt isn\'t painful.\\nYou search your symptoms online.\\nBy the time you stop reading, you\'re convinced something is seriously wrong.\",\"steps\":[{\"step_number\":1,\"key\":\"detect\",\"insight\":\"When information is incomplete, your brain often fills the gaps with the worst possible explanation.\\nThat doesn\'t make it true.\",\"inputs\":[{\"field_key\":\"facts\",\"prompt\":\"Write only the facts.\",\"multiline\":true},{\"field_key\":\"story\",\"prompt\":\"Now write the story your mind is creating.\",\"multiline\":true}],\"reference_example\":\"Fact: I noticed a small lump on my neck and searched for it online.\\nStory: I probably have a serious illness.\"},{\"step_number\":2,\"key\":\"decode\",\"prompt\":\"Which thinking trap is most likely at work?\",\"input_type\":\"single_choice\",\"options\":[{\"key\":\"catastrophizing\",\"label\":\"Catastrophizing\",\"definition\":\"Assuming the absolute worst outcome.\"},{\"key\":\"fortune_telling\",\"label\":\"Fortune Telling\",\"definition\":\"Treating an unverified prediction as certain.\"},{\"key\":\"confirmation_bias\",\"label\":\"Confirmation Bias\",\"definition\":\"Only seeing details that confirm the feared story.\"}],\"correct_option_key\":\"catastrophizing\",\"explanation_reveal\":\"after_selection\",\"explanation\":\"Why Catastrophizing.\\nFinding one possible explanation online doesn\'t mean it is the correct explanation.\\nYour mind has immediately jumped to the worst-case scenario without sufficient evidence.\"},{\"step_number\":3,\"key\":\"reality_check\",\"tip\":\"Ask \\\"What happened?\\\" before asking \\\"What could happen?\\\"\",\"inputs\":[{\"field_key\":\"q1\",\"prompt\":\"1. What fact do you know for certain?\"},{\"field_key\":\"q2\",\"prompt\":\"2. What are you assuming?\"},{\"field_key\":\"q3\",\"prompt\":\"3. What evidence supports your assumption?\"},{\"field_key\":\"q4\",\"prompt\":\"4. What evidence contradicts it?\"},{\"field_key\":\"q5\",\"prompt\":\"5. If someone else described this situation, what would you tell them?\"}]},{\"step_number\":4,\"key\":\"reframe\",\"inputs\":[{\"field_key\":\"alt_explanations\",\"prompt\":\"Write at least 3 other explanations that also fit the facts.\",\"type\":\"multi_entry\",\"min_entries\":3},{\"field_key\":\"one_more_explanation\",\"prompt\":\"Can you think of one explanation that is less serious than your first thought?\"}],\"reference_example\":[\"It could be a swollen lymph node caused by a minor infection.\",\"It could be a harmless cyst.\",\"It could be temporary and disappear in a few days.\",\"A healthcare professional can assess it properly.\"]},{\"step_number\":5,\"key\":\"intervention\",\"reminder\":\"There isn\'t always a perfect action.\\nThere is usually one reasonable action based on the evidence available.\",\"inputs\":[{\"field_key\":\"action\",\"prompt\":\"Based on the evidence available, what is one thoughtful action you can take?\"}],\"reference_example\":\"Instead of assuming the worst, make an appointment with a qualified healthcare professional and avoid drawing conclusions based only on internet searches.\"},{\"step_number\":6,\"key\":\"internalize\",\"inputs\":[{\"field_key\":\"principle\",\"prompt\":\"Complete this sentence: \\\"Today I learned that...\\\"\"}],\"reference_example\":\"The worst possible explanation is only one possibility—not a conclusion.\"}],\"closing_reflection\":{\"prompt\":\"Where else in my life have I assumed the worst before gathering enough evidence?\",\"journal_input\":{\"field_key\":\"journal\",\"prompt\":\"Optional journal entry — user may type or speak a personal reflection here (not scored).\",\"required\":false}}}', '2026-09-25 16:36:12', '2026-09-25 16:36:12')
